<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43842" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sĕrēno</span></b> , āvi,
			ātum, 1, v. a.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>to make clear</i>, <i>fair</i>, or <i>serene</i>, <i>to clear up</i> (<b>poet.</b>; syn. tranquillo). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vultu, quo caelum tempestatesque serenat
					(Juppiter),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 1, 255</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">axem,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					12, 637</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Olympum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 665</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">glauca terga aquae, Claud. de Apono, 36: domum
					largo igne,</span>”
				<i>to ligth up</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Stat. Achill. 1, 120</span></i>
			.—<b>
				<i>Absol.</i>
			</b>: luce serenanti, <i>in bright</i>, <i>clear daylight</i>, * Cic. poët.
			Div. 1, 11, 18.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Impers.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">cum serenat,</span>”
				<i>when it is clear</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Min. Fel. 32, 4</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">spem fronte serenat,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 477</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">for which: tristia fronte,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					11, 368</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nubila animi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					2, 6, 4, § 13</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
